or-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-0286a59\" data-id=\"0286a59\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8c36d99 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8c36d99\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Translation Quality \/ Certification \/ Membership<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-97ddcc5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"97ddcc5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMany clients ask us how we can guarantee quality. There\u2019s no simple answer to that, because translation is not a commodity, it is a combination of art and service. And as in any service, quality is elusive and is hard to define and guarantee because people have different desires, needs and expectations.\n<div class=\"tooltip\">Example\n<span class=\"tooltiptext\">For example, do you need a functional piece of art to cover a hole in the wall or do you need something to impress your VIP clients? Or to give you another example, suppose your tax advisor runs the numbers and announces that you have a 2,000 tax rebate. You would probably be happy\u2026 until someone else shows you how to increase it to 5,000\u2026 Then another expert mentions that you might go to prison if you follow that advice. But even if it is absolutely legitimate \u2013 still someone else points out that you would have been much better off if there was 0 rebate and the money had been invested instead to begin with. This might be true. But then some people just do not have discipline to do that. Or do not want to fill extra forms. You get the idea.<\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fb87ebf elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fb87ebf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We know you have concerns and doubts and fully understand how you feel. In fact, many other people feel the same way because they do not know what to expect.No worries \u2013 we want to treat you like a star!This is why we have developed a special 5-Star Quality Guarantee that is truly unique and unmatched in translation industry.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-c383037 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"c383037\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-8b93ed4\" data-id=\"8b93ed4\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-eff6414 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"eff6414\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"450\" height=\"348\" src=\"https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/why-us-eng.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-1638\" alt=\"Woman writing tick symbol\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/why-us-eng.png 450w, https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/why-us-eng-300x232.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ab50c0a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ab50c0a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMost of our Premium Level of Service jobs automatically qualify for our 5-Star Quality Guarantee:\n<div class=\"tooltip\">What exactly does it mean?\n<span class=\"tooltiptext\">Our projects vary in complexity and scope, so you may not need all the steps below, but suppose you decide to translate your important promotional materials that you then want to run by your clients or distributors in another country. Time is very crucial for you as a Trade Show is coming up in just a week. And you do not want to be embarrassed like your colleague who used machine translation that came up with some incomprehensible gibberish (and boy, she was lucky because another one was actually using obscenities thinking they sounded cute \u2013 what a way to attract a potential a client!). But how can you trust \/ evaluate the quality if you do not even know the language?<\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d8a8245 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d8a8245\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">With ABC Language Solutions, you receive the following deal: <\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-42c0a5e elementor-position-left elementor-view-default elementor-mobile-position-top elementor-vertical-align-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\